cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the article below and the software
  version you used. For the two-dimensional algorithm, please also cite
  arXiv:2608.09915.
title: "css-decoupling"
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-28"
