authors:
  - family-names: He
    given-names: Mingxin
    affiliation: "Chen-Ning Yang Institute for Advanced Study, Tsinghua University"
abstract: >-
  Exact decoupling of translation-invariant topological CSS codes over
  prime-field Laurent polynomial rings into stacks of higher-form toric codes,
  with the specialized two-dimensional algorithm, the general
  higher-dimensional construction, explicit SUM/SWAP circuits and
  independently verified results.
keywords:
  - quantum error correction
  - CSS codes
  - toric codes
  - quantum cellular automata
  - Laurent polynomials
